    "posts": {
      "inserted": [
        {
          "id": 53,
          "raw": "Congratulations, you've earned the **New User of the Month award for September 2026**. :trophy:\n\nThis award is only granted to two new users per month, and it will be permanently visible on [the badges page](http://localhost:3048/badges).\n\nYou've quickly become a valuable member of our community. Thanks for joining, and keep up the great work!",
          "wiki": false,
          "reads": 1,
          "score": null,
          "cooked": "<p>Congratulations, you’ve earned the <strong>New User of the Month award for September 2026</strong>. <img src=\"/images/emoji/twitter/trophy.png?v=15\" title=\":trophy:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":trophy:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>This award is only granted to two new users per month, and it will be permanently visible on <a href=\"http://localhost:3048/badges\">the badges page</a>.</p>\n<p>You’ve quickly become a valuable member of our community. Thanks for joining, and keep up the great work!</p>",
